# W4-OPENING-1 I5: the GPU window (run with --gpu): the ship turns and moves, a zoom, a pan and a resize
# leave selection working, and a held present (every present counted as failed to the window's consumers)
# stops neither the turns nor the input; the arrival is "not drawn yet" until a delivered frame shows it.
# Launch (--gpu, RTX 4090): --ship-start data/maps/candidates/ship-start-v2/lan5-ship-a.json --seat 0 --speed 200
wait frames 40
wait fact cities == 0 within 60000
pick-ship 1
expect fact selected == 1
# The ship turns toward each target and moves: north (-y, dir16 12), then east (+x, dir16 8).
sail 312 664
wait fact latest == arrived within 60000
expect fact ship.1.dir == 12
sail 332 664
wait fact tracked == 2 within 5000
wait fact latest == arrived within 60000
expect fact ship.1.dir == 8
expect fact ship.1.x == 332
expect fact ship.1.y == 664
# Zoom, pan and resize: the pointer still maps to the same ship.
lookship 1
wheel 6
wait frames 30
pan 160 60
resize 960 600
wait frames 60
lookship 1
wait frames 30
pick-ship 1
expect fact selected == 1
wheel -10
wait frames 30
lookship 1
wait frames 30
screenshot 7-zoom-resize
# A held present: the sim goes on, orders still work, the arrival is not shown until the hold ends.
hold presents
wait frames 10
sail 332 650
wait fact tracked == 3 within 5000
wait fact latest == arrived within 60000
expect fact ship.1.y == 650
expect title not drawn yet
release presents
wait turns 4
expect title (shown)
expect fact generation == 0
expect fact committed == 0
quit
